{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-3-30","kind":"proposition","title":"有圆之分求两平分之","englishTitle":"To bisect a given circumference.","book":3,"number":30,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.30","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.30/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":30,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-3-30@raw-12f8f55394e120dc","contentId":"euclid-3-30","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"12f8f55394e120dc5ce1d3747f7da4a2398b5a6c430284e713325cb3b2b0631e","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-3-30.statement","euclid-3-30.construction.1","euclid-3-30.construction.2","euclid-3-30.proof.1","euclid-3-30.proof.2","euclid-3-30.conclusion","euclid-3-30.historical.1","euclid-3-30.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-3-30.statement","contentId":"euclid-3-30","revisionId":"euclid-3-30@raw-12f8f55394e120dc","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"37900ba64e8f5fa0bae062ae207d4dd800b6cbb4927af71fafe75abe67325f87","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To bisect a given circumference."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将一个特定的环形分解"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"有圜之分求两平分之"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"寻找圆的平均分割"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-30.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-3-30","revisionId":"euclid-3-30@raw-12f8f55394e120dc","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aeefd3677f791adcd34c08af6fc9c15cec98bfed833d20543475368302f6828f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ADB be the given circumference; thus it is required to bisect the circumference ADB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ADB成为给定的环形;因此,它必须把环形ADB分成两部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-30.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-3-30","revisionId":"euclid-3-30@raw-12f8f55394e120dc","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"04d3a4da34ff8e4e058a130926f58b01feacc5732bcb39a1e8f33c07b0212c64","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be joined and bisected at C; from the point C let CD be drawn at right angles to the straight line AB, and let AD, DB be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB连接,C两侧分割;从CCD在直角绘制到AB线,让ADDB连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-30.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-3-30","revisionId":"euclid-3-30@raw-12f8f55394e120dc","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"83d2fa80b23bce16a647019bc92e44005f06d868b3ad6ff29ff9158a0f2bb8e2","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since AC is equal to CB, and CD is common, the two sides AC, CD are equal to the two sides BC, CD; and the angle ACD is equal to the angle BCD, for each is right; therefore the base AD is equal to the base DB. [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AC等于CB,CD是共同的,双方AC,CD等于BC,CD;ACD的角等于BCD,因为每个角为直角;因此,底边,AD等于底边,DB。 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-30.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-3-30","revisionId":"euclid-3-30@raw-12f8f55394e120dc","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"42162b19cbbfc5b455d32196fbb883266190287daf63761aaf0f01702995fbc1","citations":["euclid-3-28"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But equal straight lines cut off equal circumferences, the greater equal to the greater, and the less to the less; [[III. 28](/principles/euclid-3-28)] and each of the circumferences AD, DB is less than a semicircle; therefore the circumference AD is equal to the circumference DB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但等量直线切断等量环绕,数量大于较大数量,数量小于较小数量;每圈AD,DB小于半圆圈;因此,环圈AD等于环绕DB。 [[III. 28](/principles/euclid-3-28)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-30.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-3-30","revisionId":"euclid-3-30@raw-12f8f55394e120dc","order":5,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"01643a59fd145db5b8f8499c1b8ee474618583a0c2e234e0f87e14cad795b2b9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the given circumference has been bisected at the point D. Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在D点,宽度被分成两部分。 Q. E,F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-30.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-3-30","revisionId":"euclid-3-30@raw-12f8f55394e120dc","order":6,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b4349174a25279a3b8faff50e8e0e325e29cb4314d59bf25d6fe2237cf1353ef","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"有圜之分求两平分之法曰甲乙丙圜分求两平分先于分之两界作甲丙线次两平分于丁从丁作乙丁为甲丙之垂线即乙丁分甲乙丙圜分为两平分论曰从乙作乙甲乙丙两线其甲乙丁角形之甲丁与丙乙丁角形之丙丁两腰等丁乙同腰而甲丁乙与丙丁乙两直角又等即对直角之甲乙乙丙两底亦等〈一卷四〉而甲乙与乙丙两圜分亦等〈本篇十八〉则甲乙丙圜界两平分于乙矣"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"圆的平分作图方法如下：甲乙丙 找弧来找到平分，先画 甲丙 在两个边界之前；对于 丁，画 乙丁 使其垂直于 甲丙，即 乙丁 和 甲乙丙 的弧等于 乙丁。证明如下：从 乙、甲丁 和 丙乙丁 画两条线，三角形 丙丁 的边 丁乙 相等，甲丁乙 和 丙丁乙 是相等的直角；也就是说，甲乙乙丙 的底边也相等 〈一卷四〉，并且弧 甲乙 和 乙丙 也相等 〈本篇十八〉，那么 甲乙丙 的周长由 乙 平分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-30.source","contentId":"euclid-3-30","revisionId":"euclid-3-30@raw-12f8f55394e120dc","order":7,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5e66bcea6916ed1e562bf19b2c11042d228f4e7b595db479b41b7642f71d424b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.30/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.30\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-3-30:euclid-1-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-30","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-30.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.30","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.30/","sourceLabel":"I. 4"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-3-30:euclid-3-28:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-30","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-30.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-28","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.30","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.30/","sourceLabel":"III. 28"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-4-16:euclid-3-30:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-16","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-16.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-30","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.16","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.16/","sourceLabel":"III. 30"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-30:euclid-1-4:explicit","id":"euclid-1-4","book":1,"number":4,"kind":"proposition","title":"三角形全等：两边及其夹角相等","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-30:euclid-3-28:explicit","id":"euclid-3-28","book":3,"number":28,"kind":"proposition","title":"等圆内之直线等则其割本圆之分大与大小与小各等","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-4-16:euclid-3-30:explicit","id":"euclid-4-16","book":4,"number":16,"kind":"proposition","title":"圆内接正十五边形的尺规作图","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-circle","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
